                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#2v">-2v</locus>وَالمُحْصَنَاتُ مِنَ النِّسَاءِ اِلَّا مَا مَلَكَتْ اِيْمَانُكُمْ كِتَابَ اللهِ عَلَيْكُمْ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#20r">-20r</locus>مَا يَفْعَلُ اللهُ بِعَذَابِكُمْ اِنْ شَكَرْتُمْ وَاَمَنْتُمْ وَكَانَ اللهُ شَاكِراً عَلِيْماً</explicit>
                     <note>4:24-4:147. Eleven lines a page. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Numerous words completed on the following line, and words left uncompleted, which are rewritten in full on the following line. Deletions. In the margin, ḥizb mark in red ink (11v).</note>
